{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22134","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 五 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝亦独醉歌，暮亦独醉睡。\n未尽一壶酒，已成三独醉。\n勿嫌饮太少，且喜欢易致。\n一杯复两杯，多不过三四。\n便得心中适，尽忘身外事。\n更复强一杯，陶然遗万累。\n一饮一石者，徒以多爲贵。\n及其酩酊时，与我亦无异。\n笑谢多饮者，酒钱徒自费。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}